", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5-rShwIxXsQ7kNvwH-hJv6&_nc_oc=Adq6aVupPb4Ce2ViyjzhGYRH26Qe0lU8PdRcuVdYbVL5WiFQjba4DHBMkj_hldqBmNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5EUbXeB1ZtjZOVY9ZVxx4zbOvmeuqi_ZXaNlNjNkaHJQ&oe=6A087379"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RYCtmVo95l0Q7kNvwFpuEfc&_nc_oc=AdpoLw2iB6JGQj9BtefA0OtYjIFjeY6Zdg8SQgri9kxcgpJPk73ZJ9WRAuJ5guRFnA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af72rEPk0weHL1Mq5Ij2eK-aE79lv2C4L3cPbaE3__E3Hg&oe=6A088A4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9RbLN_VrbK8Q7kNvwHe6Qsc&_nc_oc=Adqtb6BZWIIrGeDBoJilQO3QYV44-zsG-suE6nLbMkn7s9pLJBAa6_VjIEagiGnqAfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af43yrUHuNsaDaphejVtvSTq2xHJSPfAF6CDyO3m_96aSg&oe=6A0888CE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel